{"additions":38,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Problem\n\nmain's CI failed once after #174 merged: `projects::state::tests::linked_projects_drive_the_board_and_p_cycles_them` saw a board arrive that it never sent. The fixture integration tests set the process-global replay directory, and a worker thread spawned by that unrelated test (running in parallel in the same test binary) replayed the fixture board instead of calling `gh`.\n\n## Fix\n\nThe two fixture tests become `#[ignore]`d twins (`…_isolated`) that a plain wrapper test runs through `gh_fixture::run_isolated`, which re-executes the test binary for exactly that test (`--exact --ignored --test-threads=1`). Replay then lives in its own process and can't leak into anything else; the lock / drop-guard from the review are no longer needed and are gone.\n\nVerified with three consecutive full `cargo test` runs (394 passed, 2 ignored — the twins, which the wrappers still execute) and by running the twins directly.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":3,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-08T13:37:02Z","deletions":28,"headRefName":"fix/fixture-test-isolation","labels":[],"number":176,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMoOnlQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe GitHub wrapper test passes an incorrect fully-qualified test name to `run_isolated`, which can prevent the intended isolated test from running at all.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR fixes flaky CI caused by process-global `gh` fixture replay configuration leaking across parallel tests by moving the fixture-replay integration tests into their own re-executed test-binary process.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add `core::gh_fixture::run_isolated()` to re-run an `#[ignore]`d test in a child process with `--exact --ignored --test-threads=1`.\n- Split the two fixture integration tests into wrapper tests plus `#[ignore]`d `…_isolated` twins that do the actual replay setup.\n- Remove the prior in-process `REPLAY_LOCK` + drop-guard reset approach.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| src/core/gh_fixture.rs | Adds `run_isolated()` helper to execute ignored fixture tests in a separate process. |\r\n| src/projects/state.rs | Wraps the Projects fixture integration test to run its isolated twin out-of-process; removes lock/reset guard. |\r\n| src/github/state.rs | Wraps the GitHub fixture integration test to run its isolated twin out-of-process; removes lock/reset guard. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 3/3 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T13:39:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"ec770532cd516dce448c2ee74f6d698332177d0c"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMoUrEw","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"ec770532cd516dce448c2ee74f6d698332177d0c"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMoWidA","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe ignored “_isolated” tests can still be executed directly (e.g., via `cargo test -- --ignored`), which would reintroduce the original process-global fixture replay leakage unless guarded.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 3/3 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 3\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T13:50:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"43c23e33135cfbd4ee7f620efa36ef2a05ea50b1"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T07:02:54Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34321905536/job/102370255132","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-09T07:03:02Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T13:49:34Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34234217656/job/102087666018","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:10Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:47Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34234217683/job/102087666421","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:11Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T13:49:11Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34234217656/job/102087666147","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:12Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T13:50:12Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34234217656/job/102087665753","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:15Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T13:50:12Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34234217656/job/102088404339","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-09-08T13:50:13Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T07:02:54Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34321905536/job/102370251106","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-09-09T07:03:01Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T13:49:20Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34234217683/job/102087666784","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:11Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T13:49:21Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34234217683/job/102087666756","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T13:48:13Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T07:02:54Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34321905536/job/102370223944","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-09-09T07:02:54Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"🐛 Run the fixture-replay tests in their own process"}
